=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Aladoverre (A)} at (E-7) to activate the quest.
** Veridical Conflux #08 is the closest teleport nearby.
* Your objective is to obtain a {@k} {k:Chipped linkshell}, {@k} {k:Cracked linkshell}, AND {@k} {k:Grimy linkshell} from various **???** targetable locations throughout the zone.
* There are 5 areas where a **???** can spawn to obtain one of the {@k} linkshells.
** Amongst the {m:Helter-skelter} near Conflux #8.
** Between the {m:Peapuks|Peapuk} and {m:Russet Rarabs|Russet Rarab} northwest of Conflux #6.
** Amongst the {m:Aestutaur} near Conflux #4.
** The 4th and 5th spots jump throughout various spots in the zone, so it is best to just visit the three spots above since they never move.
*** It is important to note that only one {@k} linkshell can be obtained from each **???**.
* Return to Aladoverre (A) once all 3 {@k} linkshells are obtained to complete the quest and receive your reward.

__Zoning **is** required in order to repeat this quest.__
